   "reason": "Nonfarm business labour productivity, year on year (BLS PRS85006091): Sep 2025 2.5%, Dec 2025 2.5%, Mar 2026 2.9%, Jun 2026 2.2%. Latest 2.2% sits inside the normal band (<=2.5%), around the post-war 2.1% trend. Initial seed.",
